{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF1", "text": "There's a critical gap we need to address before publishing. Yesterday, while helping the release team debug a separate build, I confirmed that the production release pipeline uses privileged Docker-in-Docker, which cannot run on the proposed ephemeral runner profile. The workable design is exactly two isolated persistent runners dedicated to release jobs, with the remaining jobs on ephemeral runners. I haven't updated the platform proposal yet, so the current policy doesn't account for this hybrid setup."}
```

